direction: right
Admin: Administrator {shape: person}
Portal: Provisioning portal {shape: page}
Saga: Tenant saga {shape: hexagon}
Identity: Identity service {shape: rectangle}
Database: Database provisioner {shape: rectangle}
Storage: Storage provisioner {shape: rectangle}
Billing: Billing service {shape: rectangle}
Tenants: Tenant registry {shape: cylinder}
Work: Durable work queue {shape: queue}
Admin -> Portal: create tenant
Portal -> Saga: provision
Saga -> Identity: create organization
Identity -> Saga: organization ready
Saga -> Database: create database
Database -> Saga: database ready
Saga -> Storage: create bucket
Storage -> Saga: bucket ready
Saga -> Billing: start subscription
Billing -> Saga: subscription active
Saga -> Tenants: mark active
Saga -> Work: persist next step
Billing -> Saga: activation failed
Saga -> Storage: delete bucket
Saga -> Database: delete database
Saga -> Identity: delete organization
Saga -> Tenants: mark failed
